        trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, but you won’t be charged until the 14-day trial ends. Cancel anytime. During your trial, you get up to 10,000 items scanned to test the platform. The free trial applies to base plans only.
        Add-ons (Supplier Monitoring and AI Leads) are billed immediately."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens if I go over my SKU limits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You’ll get a notification before you hit your limit. From there,
        you can upgrade to the next plan or add capacity à la carte."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does annual billing work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Annual billing saves you 2 months compared to monthly pricing. You pay upfront
